 "value" "Given the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]$, find the result of applying to $A$ the following  elementary row operations:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1}=\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}-1}{R}_{1},\\,{R}_{2}={R}_{2}-2\\text{i}{R}_{1}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39014" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2\\text{i}-1}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2\\text{i}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39014" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "37ba5df55475007f46a653df2e9ada705233f87b3c21410d3cbcfaa3ff4acf79"} {"question" "q-39014" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39014" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2\\text{i} \\\\ 2\\text{i} & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39014" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39005" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ -2\\text{i} & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$, find the result of applying to $A$ the following elementary row operation:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+\\frac{2\\text{i}}{1+\\text{i}}{R}_{1}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39005" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ -2\\text{i} & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+\\frac{2\\text{i}}{1+\\text{i}}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ -2\\text{i}+\\frac{2\\text{i}(1+\\text{i})}{1+\\text{i}} & \\text{i}+\\frac{2\\text{i}(1-\\text{i})}{1+\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ -2\\text{i}+2\\text{i} & \\text{i}+\\frac{2(\\text{i}+1)}{1+\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}+2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result  is \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}+2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39005" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "37ba5df55475007f46a653df2e9ada705233f87b3c21410d3cbcfaa3ff4acf79"} {"question" "q-39005" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "31710d2c7ffd1f9d9081e048833f4c1b154f9f477e209030e29e66492e86d933"} {"question" "q-39005" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & \\text{i}+2 \\\\ -2\\text{i} & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ -4\\text{i} & \\text{i}-2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}+2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\text{i} & \\text{i}+2\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256